{
  "A compact element with short text and an optional leading icon or avatar. Use it as a filter, as a choice among a few options, or to represent a selected item that can be removed. A group handles single or multiple selection and arrow key navigation.": "",
  "Appearance and states": "",
  "Selection in a group": "",
  "`selection` turns chips into selectable options. `value` holds their values, and `onValueChanged` reports changes.": "",
  "Removing chips": "",
  "A removable chip only sends a request. Remove the item from your list in `onRemove`, and the group updates to match.": "",
  "Presses the chip, which toggles a selectable chip or selects one in a group.": "",
  "Requests removal of a removable chip.": "",
  "In a group, moves between the chips. The group has one Tab stop, on the chip focused last.": "",
  "A button with `aria-pressed`.": "`aria-pressed` taşıyan bir düğme.",
  "The group is a `listbox` (`aria-multiselectable` for multiple selection), and each chip is an `option` with `aria-selected`.": "",
  "The remove button is named “Remove Ada” in the kit language. Keyboard users reach it with Delete on the chip.": "",
  "Removed from the Tab order and marked with `aria-disabled`.": "",
  "The remove button's name is the `removeItem` kit string (“Remove {text}”) and changes with the kit language (`uiLocale`).": "",
  "The chip. `data-size`, `data-variant`, `data-selected`, `data-pressable`, `data-removable`, `data-lead`, `data-check`, `data-disabled`.": "Chip. `data-size`, `data-variant`, `data-selected`, `data-pressable`, `data-removable`, `data-lead`, `data-check`, `data-disabled`.",
  "The content before the text.": "",
  "The text and the remove button.": "",
  "The group. `data-wrap`.": "Grup. `data-wrap`.",
  "Unit: the chip, filled at rest, then `outline`, each tone filled and outlined (`accent` … `danger`, `outline-*`), and `selected`, `hover`, `pressed`, `focus` and `disabled`.": "",
  "Units: the icon or check mark, and the remove button (`hover`, `pressed`).": "",
  "The chip, its text and its spacing, per size.": "",
  "The content before and after the text, per size. An avatar and the remove button have the same inset from the edge as from the top and bottom.": "",
  "The default appearance, and whether a selected chip shows a check mark (Material).": "",
  "The space between chips.": "Chip'ler arası boşluk.",
  "Chip props": "Chip prop'ları",
  "Its text": "",
  "The value it represents in a group.": "",
  "An icon before the text: an image address, an element or a component.": "Metnin önünde icon: resim adresi, öğe ya da bileşen.",
  "An avatar before the text (its props; the chip sets the size).": "",
  "Pressing the chip toggles it, as a filter. In a group with selection, the group controls it.": "",
  "Indicates whether the chip is on.": "",
  "Lets the chip be pressed like a button (`onclick`).": "",
  "Adds a remove button after the text. The button, Delete and Backspace raise `onRemove`.": "",
  "`filled` or `outline`. Material draws chips outlined, and the other design languages draw them filled.": "",
  "`standard`, `accent`, `info`, `success`, `caution` or `danger`. A selected chip shows the selection color instead.": "",
  "Chip events": "Chip event'leri",
  "Occurs when the user requests removal (`byKeyboard`). Your code performs the removal.": "",
  "Occurs when the chip is turned on or off (`selected`), either by the user or programmatically (`byUser`).": "",
